            "value": "传输与占位："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "走 CDN 并压缩；首屏外 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "loading=\"lazy\""
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "。标签或 CSS 写死宽高（或 "
